{"type":"standard","title":"Jake Ellzey","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Jake Ellzey</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q105061782","titles":{"canonical":"Jake_Ellzey","normalized":"Jake Ellzey","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Jake Ellzey</span></span>"},"pageid":57053182,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/Jake_Ellzey_Official_Portrait_-_117th_Congress_%28full%29.png/330px-Jake_Ellzey_Official_Portrait_-_117th_Congress_%28full%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7c/Jake_Ellzey_Official_Portrait_-_117th_Congress_%28full%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1764,"height":2205},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1381397583","tid":"6025969a-cdd5-11f1-96de-60e76ae3b5e5","timestamp":"2026-10-22T04:59:35Z","description":"American politician (born 1970)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jake_Ellzey","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jake_Ellzey?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jake_Ellzey?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Jake_Ellzey"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jake_Ellzey","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Jake_Ellzey","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jake_Ellzey?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Jake_Ellzey"}},"extract":"John Kevin \"Jake\" Ellzey Sr. is an American politician and former military officer serving as the U.S. representative for Texas's 6th congressional district since 2021. A member of the Republican Party, he previously served as a commissioner for the Texas Veterans Commission and later as a member of the Texas House of Representatives for the 10th district from January to July 2021. He served in the United States Navy as a fighter pilot, completing tours in Afghanistan and Iraq.","extract_html":"<p><b>John Kevin</b> \"<b>Jake</b>\" <b>Ellzey Sr.</b> is an American politician and former military officer serving as the U.S. representative for Texas's 6th congressional district since 2021. A member of the Republican Party, he previously served as a commissioner for the Texas Veterans Commission and later as a member of the Texas House of Representatives for the 10th district from January to July 2021. He served in the United States Navy as a fighter pilot, completing tours in Afghanistan and Iraq.</p>"}